OL,3,ATrump and Xi exchange warm words at
OL,4,Astate dinner but little progress on key
OL,5,Aissues
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump and China's
OL,8,FPresident Xi Jinping exchanged warm
OL,9,Fwords at a lavish White House state
OL,10,Fdinner but gave little indication of
OL,11,Fprogress on pressing issues.
OL,13,FXi stressed that the countries should
OL,14,Fensure AI remain "under human control"
OL,15,Fand act "as responsible major
OL,16,Fcountries", while Trump toasted a
OL,17,Ffuture of "harmony, peace and success"
OL,18,Ffor both nations.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
